// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖aggregationcomponents🔖tree🪨filetreeitem](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Aggregation%20Components/s/Tree/d/i/FileTreeItem)
