// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻elements🔖windowcomponents🔖window🪨window](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/elements.tsx/s/Window%20Components/s/Window/d/i/Window)
