/** YPieceVal holds the data fields for a YPieceVal record.
// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻sketchpad🔖piece✂️ypieceval](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Sketchpad.tsx/s/Piece/d/i/YPieceVal)
