 * [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖imports🔖panels🔖windowlibrary✂️windowtemplate](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Imports/s/Panels/s/WindowLibrary/d/i/WindowTemplate)
