// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖imports🔖store🔖hooks🛠️usedesignappinitialize](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Imports/s/Store/s/Hooks/d/i/useDesignAppInitialize)
