 *  * [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖imports🔖panels🔖details🪨singleconnectionfields](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Imports/s/Panels/s/Details/d/i/SingleConnectionFields)
