// [👤semio📚js🗃️sketchpad💻design🔖canvas🔖scene🪨planethree](semiorepo://p/u/semio/b/l/js/fd/org/sketchpad/f/Design.tsx/s/Canvas/s/Scene/d/i/PlaneThree)
/**
